DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaiioo__wwaaiittccoommpplleettee() system call waits for completion of an asynchro‐
     nous I/O request.  Upon completion, aaiioo__wwaaiittccoommpplleettee() returns the result
     of the function and sets _i_o_c_b_p to point to the structure associated with
     the original request.  If an asynchronous I/O request is completed before
     aaiioo__wwaaiittccoommpplleettee() is called, it returns immediately with the completed
     request.

     If _t_i_m_e_o_u_t is a non-NULL pointer, it specifies a maximum interval to wait
     for a asynchronous I/O request to complete.  If _t_i_m_e_o_u_t is a NULL
     pointer, aaiioo__wwaaiittccoommpplleettee() waits indefinitely.  To effect a poll, the
     _t_i_m_e_o_u_t argument should be non-NULL, pointing to a zero-valued timeval
     structure.

     The aaiioo__wwaaiittccoommpplleettee() system call also serves the function of
     aaiioo__rreettuurrnn(), thus aaiioo__rreettuurrnn() should not be called for the control
     block returned in _i_o_c_b_p.

RREETTUURRNN VVAALLUUEESS
     If an asynchronous I/O request has completed, _i_o_c_b_p is set to point to
     the control block passed with the original request, and the status is re‐
     turned as described in read(2), write(2), or fsync(2).  On failure,
     aaiioo__wwaaiittccoommpplleettee() returns -1, sets iocbp to NULL and sets _e_r_r_n_o to indi‐
     cate the error condition.

EERRRROORRSS
     The aaiioo__wwaaiittccoommpplleettee() system call fails if:

     [EINVAL]           The specified time limit is invalid.

     [EAGAIN]           The process has not yet called aaiioo__rreeaadd() or
                        aaiioo__wwrriittee().

     [EINTR]            A signal was delivered before the timeout expired and
                        before any asynchronous I/O requests completed.

     [EWOULDBLOCK]

     [EINPROGRESS]      The specified time limit expired before any asynchro‐
                        nous I/O requests completed.

